  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the ratio of the fifth term from the beginning to the fifth term from the end in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the third term from the beginning is:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
