  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given expansion is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p>We know that general term of an expansion&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;term from beginning)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;term from end)</p>We know&nbsp;that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>th term from the end in a binomial expansion is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;from the beginning.<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>It is also given that the ratio of&nbsp;the fifth term from the beginning to the fifth term from the end is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>&#39;</mo></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mroot></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
